<em><strong>If no claim has been settled with the customer directly use:&nbsp;</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>What we need from you&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;</strong><br />
To assist in reviewing your claim, please provide as much of the following information as possible, which you can send through to us by replying to this email:&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>Baggage receipts given to the claimant at check in; &nbsp;</li>
	<li>Proof of purchase &nbsp;</li>
	<li>Pictures of damage to bag &nbsp;</li>
	<li>Brand of bag, age of bag, original cost of bag.&nbsp;</li>
	<li>For Brand Bag/Items please provide us with a written confirmation of: &nbsp;
	<ul>
		<li>The authentication, and &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
